{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "签名之前",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 76.68,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "如果你是普通用户，先记住几条。",
   "spoken": "如果你是普通用户，先记住几条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.692,
   "speechEnd": 4.183
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "官方从不要求你签名领取空投，或者签名验证钱包。",
   "spoken": "官方从不要求你签名领取空投，或者签名验证钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 4.715,
   "speechEnd": 8.836
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "签名前看三样，授权给谁，授权多少，到什么时候。",
   "spoken": "签名前看三样，授权给谁，授权多少，到什么时候。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 9.24,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 9.24,
   "speechEnd": 14.171
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "看不懂就不签，不花 Gas，不等于没有风险。",
   "spoken": "看不懂就不签，不花 Gas，不等于没有风险。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 14.58,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 14.675,
   "speechEnd": 18.373
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "大额资产和日常交互，用不同的钱包。",
   "spoken": "大额资产和日常交互，用不同的钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 18.8,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 18.9,
   "speechEnd": 22.124
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "每个月撤销不用的授权，买新币前，先确认它能卖出去。",
   "spoken": "每个月撤销不用的授权，买新币前，先确认它能卖出去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 22.54,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 22.54,
   "speechEnd": 27.167
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "已经签下钓鱼签名，就立刻撤销授权，把剩余资产转到新地址。",
   "spoken": "已经签下钓鱼签名，就立刻撤销授权，把剩余资产转到新地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 27.64,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 27.735,
   "speechEnd": 33.169
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "如果你做钱包产品，今天就查一件事，签名请求能不能解码成可读字段。",
   "spoken": "如果你做钱包产品，今天就查一件事，签名请求能不能解码成可读字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 33.54,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 33.633,
   "speechEnd": 39.414
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "如果你在交易所，查一查提币时有没有比对首尾相同的历史地址。",
   "spoken": "如果你在交易所，查一查提币时有没有比对首尾相同的历史地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 39.84,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 39.936,
   "speechEnd": 45.437
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 45.82,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 45.82,
   "speechEnd": 47.001
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "测试转账已经到账，从记录里复制地址，并不安全。",
   "spoken": "测试转账已经到账，从记录里复制地址，并不安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 47.4,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 47.4,
   "speechEnd": 51.548
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "测试只证明那一刻的地址是对的，证明不了你之后复制的是同一个。",
   "spoken": "测试只证明那一刻的地址是对的，证明不了你之后复制的是同一个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 52.02,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 52.119,
   "speechEnd": 57.339
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "地址要从地址簿，或者收款方的安全渠道取，再核对完整地址，不只看首尾。",
   "spoken": "地址要从地址簿，或者收款方的安全渠道取，再核对完整地址，不只看首尾。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 57.76,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 57.856,
   "speechEnd": 64.688
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "私钥完好无损，资产也可能没了，每次确认之前，先看清你在签什么。",
   "spoken": "私钥完好无损，资产也可能没了，每次确认之前，先看清你在签什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 65.1,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 65.1,
   "speechEnd": 71.147
  },
  {
